prompt:
Our daily Snowflake ELT pipeline is breaking because our source data schema (which I've attached below) changes without notice. We need to handle schema evolution gracefully, track bad rows in a dead-letter queue, and send real-time alerts to Slack. How should we build this ingestion flow using dbt and Snowflake?

JSON Schema:
{
  'type': 'object',
  'properties': {
    'event_id': {'type': 'string'},
    'timestamp': {'type': 'integer'},
    'payload': {
      'type': 'object',
      'properties': {
        'user_id': {'type': 'string'},
        'action': {'type': 'string'}
      }
    }
  }
}
